WEBVTT

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.820
You still don’t know the truth.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.960
Bro!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.700
Let’s get going!

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:22.820
Everyone…

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.710
I’ve made my decision.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.550
Kusanagi.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.780
Hey, Yusaku.  Sit down.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.890
Thanks for running the cart while I was away.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.120
Is your brother okay?

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.450
Yeah.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:48.780
After regaining consciousness, 
he’s gotten a lot better.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.600
He might be able to leave the hospital soon.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.600
I see.  That’s good.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.600
The doctor said that when 
he regained consciousness...

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:02.440
...Jin’s memories of the 
Lost Incident vanished.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.440
Weird, huh?

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.570
His memories vanished…  Can it be?

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:18.420
When Lightning dueled Revolver, he changed 
some of his consciousness data into extra life.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:22.490
Those may have been memories 
of the Lost Incident.

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.570
I see.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.200
If that’s true, that’s 
a blessing in disguise.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.890
That experience was painful.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:36.440
If he's no longer trapped 
by his past, that’s good.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.910
His life will now begin.

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:41.090
Yeah.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.880
By the way, has Ai returned?

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:49.040
No.  I don’t think he’ll ever return.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.890
I see.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:55.120
Then your new life will also now begin.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.900
Eat something.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.460
Thank you.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:02.000
The world's first human-type android, SOLtiS!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.000
SOLtiS will change the world!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.470
An android with a built-in AI.

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:20.660
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:48.630
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:58.540
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:03.780
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:12.320
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:17.460
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:23.130
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:27.440
calling  With invisible wings

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:38.050
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.980
SOLtiS is selling amazingly!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:50.280
We only started selling, 
but we have lots of orders!

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:54.780
And lots of contracts with large companies!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.700
Now that LINK VRAINS is closed, the 
company's future rests on this project.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.490
That’s right, Executive Director Zaizen!

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:06.490
I’m still not used to that title.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.410
What are you talking about?

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:12.360
Executive Director is the 
#2 rank in our company!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:16.560
Because you’re the hero 
who saved LINK VRAINS!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.670
That wasn’t me.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:23.640
If it wasn’t for Playmaker, 
I couldn’t have saved anyone.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.530
You’re so modest!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:30.520
I rewatch what you did in LINK VRAINS 
everyday, Executive Director Zaizen!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.650
I’ve seen it over a 100 times!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:39.330
That means you've watched me fall 
unconscious over a 100 times.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:42.180
I guess...

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.530
But your actions have spread worldwide, 
Executive Director Zaizen!

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:51.840
Even the Queen couldn’t stop your 
promotion, Executive Director Zaizen!

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:59.740
Why did Bohman leave footage of 
the final duel in our camera?

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:04.980
Maybe he wanted others to remember him.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:09.740
For our network, this program 
has the highest ratings by far!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:12.020
We're definitely getting a bonus!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.680
Not just a bonus.  I'll 
become the Bureau Chief!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.090
You'll be the Bureau Chief?

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.230
Then I'll be Vice Bureau Chief!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.470
You fools!

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.440
What?

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.910
Stop slacking off, Yamamoto and Sato!

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.800
This voice...

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:31.910
It's the Bureau Chief!

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:37.250
That’s right.  I was monitoring 
your work from here the whole time.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.980
You're aiming for my job?  How rude!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.460
You get no bonus.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:52.300
Bureau Chief, my name is Saito.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.800
By the way, the other thing?

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.840
Here.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.360
That’s a lot.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.300
Most are complaints.  That our 
company cost them their jobs.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:06.540
I see.  I expected that, but…

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:10.620
But it’s not something the Executive 
Director has to worry about.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:16.120
Society has changed into favoring 
convenience.  No one can stop that.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.770
You’re right.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:21.530
But I'm reminded of what Playmaker said.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:27.080
I asked him why we fight the Ignis.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.270
What did he say?

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.850
People don’t want sudden changes.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.340
Sudden changes can hurt people.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:38.310
That’s what he said.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.690
You worry too much.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:44.650
Executive Director Zaizen is the 
captain who steers SOL Technologies.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:51.660
He navigates society's ocean 
until his voyage is over.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:55.610
And I will voyage by the captain’s side.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:56.960
What are you talking about?

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:13.550
SOL Technologies’ androids are incredible.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:17.920
This ship is the ultimate advertisement 
of my company’s androids.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:23.920
This ship will let the world know 
of SOL Technologies’ abilities.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.140
They might take my job someday.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.030
Bro, here they are!

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:35.630
Here!  Here!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.650
It worked!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.720
They won't find out, will they?

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.720
I made no mistakes.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:58.720
I hacked the control system.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.890
We won't leave behind any data.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.760
Well done.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:08.230
Thanks for making me into this.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:14.240
When my backup was rebuilt, it affected you.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:18.210
I never expected you'd get free will.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.210
It was foggy at start.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.320
But it became clearer as I got smarter.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:27.320
Having free will is great!

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:33.260
Being smart is great!  I feel very free!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:36.900
Thanks to SOL Technologies, 
I also have this body!

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:42.700
Yeah.  It’s good timing that they 
started selling something useful.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.740
What is this place?

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:48.260
It’s like an amusement park.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.440
It’s a casino.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.290
What's a casino?

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.810
Humans play by betting money.

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.570
They get wildly excited for 
tiny chances of winning.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.520
Humans are dumb.

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.950
I thought "dumb" was a forbidden word.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:05.920
A good boy is allowed to say "dumb."

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.900
So I have to match these pictures?

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.700
That’s easy.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.540
Sheesh.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.140
Sorry, Bro!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.740
Humans will discover our identities.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.740
Don’t be stingy!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:30.980
We can live how we want without 
worrying about humans!

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.520
Bro!

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:36.590
If you’re gonna do it, do it spectacularly!

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:42.290
Wow!  Impressive, Bro!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.300
Forget it.  Let’s go.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.300
Okay!

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.450
In the back.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.760
Hey, wake up.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.020
Who are you?

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:14.540
My name is Ai.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.490
I’m Roboppi!

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.810
Ai?

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:21.720
Maybe you'll understand if 
I say Dark Ignis instead.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:24.850
I’m not an Ignis!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.240
You be quiet.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.040
Okay!

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.970
Dark Ignis…

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:33.210
I heard that you vanished.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.660
But you’re pretending to be a human!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.450
I threw away my past self.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:40.490
What’s your goal?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.460
I was thinking of using SOL Technologies.

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:48.840
To do that, I need your code key.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.430
And I also want revenge for Earth.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.060
Earth?

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.410
The Earth Ignis.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.440
You cut him to pieces.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:02.980
You’re SOL’s top management, right?

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:06.980
Let’s be sportsmanlike 
and settle this in a duel.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.250
Where am I?

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.000
This is my digital world.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.460
No one will interfere.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:28.970
Since I came here, I copied the 
largest stage on this ship.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.200
Impressive, Bro!  How thoughtful!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.670
Be quiet.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.870
Okay!

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:38.040
Stop being arrogant!  You’re just an AI!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.010
Seems you want to duel.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.780
Then let’s go.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.930
Duel!

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:05.760
You brought out a lot on your first turn.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.910
Appear!  The circuit that leads to power!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.580
Link Summon!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.180
Link 3 Golden Allure Queen!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.920
The Field Spell, Allure Palace’s effect!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:29.890
As long as this card is faceup, 
Allure Queen gains 500 ATK and DEF!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:33.230
And Golden Allure Queen’s effect!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:39.770
It gains ATK equal to the 
Allure Queen next to its link!

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.470
5000 ATK.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:49.200
When I have Allure Palace, and Allure Queen 
is the target of an attack or effect...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:54.690
...it’s not destroyed this turn, and 
monsters on your field are destroyed!

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.050
I see.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:00.020
And with the Continuous 
Spell, Allure Dance...

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:06.900
...even if summon a monster, I must attack 
Golden Allure Queen, which has the most ATK.

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:09.600
Impressive, Bro!  You already figured it out!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.440
I’m in trouble.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.860
Yeah!  You’re in trouble!

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:18.560
It’s impressive that you 
did a lot in one turn.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.660
Yeah!  A large serving of wonton!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.540
Be quiet.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.610
Okay!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.020
I end my turn.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.220
You shouldn’t underestimate me.

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.590
I'm not willing to lose to you.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:33.320
You’re the one who’s underestimating me.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:37.280
You think you can defeat this formation?

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:40.530
Totally.  It’ll be really easy.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:43.900
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:48.090
I activate the Field Spell, Ignister AiLand!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.910
When there are no monsters 
in my Main Monster Zone...

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:57.010
...I can Special Summon a Level 4 
or lower @Ignister from my hand.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:14:00.020
Come, Pikari @Ignister!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:05.320
Appear!  The circuit that guides the dark!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.550
Link Summon!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.220
Link 1 Linguriboh!

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:15.370
Ignister AiLand’s effect activates!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.370
Appear!  Bururu @Ignister!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:23.250
And I Normal Summon Doyon @Ignister.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.110
The summoned Doyon’s effect activates!

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.020
I add an @Ignister in 
my graveyard to my hand.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:36.120
Appear!  The circuit that guides the dark!

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:41.390
The summoning conditions are three 
Cyberses which includes a Dark Attribute.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.520
The creation of dark shadows!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.830
The wisdom of the dark night 
scatters throughout the world!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:50.400
Dance!  Whirl!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:55.380
The maelstrom gathers in my hand to 
become the power of rising vigor!

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.380
- The abyss-
- That’s too long, Bro!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.560
Surpass limitations!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.850
Link Summon!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:09.290
Appear, Link 3 Dark Templar @Ignister!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.130
You wrapped up a lot!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:20.240
Ignister AiLand’s effect 
activates for the third time!

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:22.400
I Special Summon Pikari.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:29.570
Dark Templar @Ignister’s effect activates!

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:33.100
When a monster is Special 
Summoned next to its link...

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:35.780
... I Special Summon as many Level 4 or lower @Ignisters

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:40.820
as possible from my graveyard next to my Link Monster’s links.

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:43.960
Resurrect, Doyon and Bururu!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:49.130
I tune Wind Attribute Level 
3 Bururu with Level 4 Doyon!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:59.200
Chaos that roams the dark road!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:02.440
The gale that soars the blue 
sky will bring the path!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.410
Synchro Summon!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:11.220
Appear, Level 7 Wind Pegasus @Ignister!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:15.370
You wrapped it up flawlessly this time!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.130
Stop commenting on everything.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.930
I activate Bururu’s 
effect from my graveyard.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:24.540
When it’s used to summon 
a Cyverse Synchro Monster...

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:29.430
...I can Special Summon the other monster 
used to Synchro Summon from my graveyard.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.250
Resurrect, Doyon!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.910
I have two Level 4 monsters!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.780
I overlay Doyon and Light Attribute Pikari!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:44.380
With these two monsters, I 
build the Overlay Network!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:54.430
The supernatural!  Earth-shattering!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:58.400
Awaken that power from eternal lamentation!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:02.370
Xyz Summon!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.850
Come, Rank 4!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:16.310
Light Dragon @Ignister!

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:20.970
2300 ATK.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.890
That’s not enough to defeat me.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:29.860
I have Golden Allure Queen 
on my field with 5000 ATK!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.530
You can't win with this formation.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.270
Are you sure?

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:40.500
Wind Pegasus’s effect activates!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:47.110
For every @Ignister on my field, 
I destroy your spell or trap card.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:51.220
Bro has three @Ignisters on his field!

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:56.350
I destroy Allure Palace and Allure Dance.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:01.290
Now your Field Spell’s effect is over!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:11.980
Since Allure Queen LV7’s ATK have 
decreased, Golden Allure Queen’s ATK also decrease!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:17.580
I activate Light Dragon @Ignister’s effect!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:25.580
By using one Overlay Unit, for every @Ignister 
on my field, I can destroy one of your monsters!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:29.360
Bro can destroy up to three monsters!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.120
What?

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:36.360
I destroy Golden Allure 
Queen and Allure Queen LV7.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.530
He emptied my field easily!

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.940
Battle!  Wind Pegasus attacks you directly!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:52.740
The next attack will end you.

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.050
I won’t let you!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:58.020
I’m the top at SOL Technologies!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:01.020
I can’t lose like this!

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:03.410
I activate my Skill!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.890
Honey Trap!

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:08.780
Oh my.  A Skill during a Master Duel?

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:12.130
Since I make the rules, 
nothing is impossible!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.900
That’s cheating!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:14.720
Be quiet!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:15.460
Okay!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.370
You’re going to be quiet?

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:23.860
When I’m attacked directly, Honey Trap 
lets me regain LP equal to the battle damage.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:27.720
And I can set a trap card 
that's not in my deck.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:31.350
And I can activate the card I set this turn!

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:35.820
I set Drowning Mirror Force!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:44.030
If you attack, your monsters 
will be sent back to your deck!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.400
You used your Skill, but 
that’s all you can do?

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:51.770
I activate Linguriboh’s 
effect from my graveyard.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:56.620
I tribute an @Ignister that was Special 
Summoned from the Extra Deck...

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.010
.. to Special Summon it from my graveyard.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:02.010
Appear, Linguriboh!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.560
I'm continuing the battle.

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:09.120
Go, Light Dragon @Ignister!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.220
You fool!  I activate my trap!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:15.190
Drowning Mirror Force!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:22.450
When your monster attacks me directly, all your 
monsters in attack position return to your deck-

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.660
Linguriboh’s effect activates!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:32.570
When your trap card activates, I can tribute 
this card to negate and banish your trap.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:45.860
Dark Templar attacks you directly!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.890
No way!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:57.230
I told you this would be an easy victory.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:03.140
What?  Are you sure?

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:05.240
I see.  I'm coming now.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.860
What is it, brother?

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.750
Something serious.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:11.720
Serious?

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.420
Then Queen has fallen.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:17.720
You don’t need to worry.  I’m going.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.620
What’s Queen’s condition?

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:30.740
She’s unconscious and taken to 
the hospital in critical condition.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:32.290
How about the press?

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:40.200
There’s a gag order in place, so 
it hasn’t leaked to outsiders yet.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.250
Thank you.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.080
What happened?

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:48.820
There’s something I want you to see.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:51.060
What is it?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:55.420
The culprit left data, taking 
credit for the crime.

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:57.030
The culprit?

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:58.600
This.

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.020
This is…

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:09.560
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:17.010
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:23.980
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.950
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:34.490
The next sentimental

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:45.740
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.180
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.380
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:07.760
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:13.190
Are you ready?

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:18.540
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:23.740
Are you ready?

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:30.850
Are you ready?

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:41.300
I would like you to protect me.

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:48.090
Akira Zaizen's request brings 
Playmaker and duelists together.

00:23:48.090 --> 00:23:51.940
He invites an impressive roster.

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:57.480
This shows that the situation is serious.

00:23:57.480 --> 00:23:59.580
Give me some time.

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.850
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Intercept

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:06.210
Into the VRAINS!
